    "describe_ch": "本課程主要介紹事業廢棄物與有害廢棄物之管理及法令規範、案例介紹、污染預防、貯存設施操作與管理、有害廢棄物物化處理技術、生物處理技術、熱處理技術、穩定化/固化處理技術，以及有害廢棄物最終處置技術。",
    "describe_eh": "This course mainly introduce the treatment technologies and management of industrial waste and hazardous waste, including the regulation framework, case study, pollution prevention, life cycle assessment, facility development and operations, physicochemical process, biological methods, thermal methods, stabilization and solidification, and final land disposal.",
